# Shipping live files

App owns I/O + yaml. ShipStation secrets are warehouse-shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files/` | Input desfiles |
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files - Processed/` | Archived inputs |
| `Shipping Label Generator/shipping_config.yaml` | Tuneables |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation secrets |
| `Shipping Label Generator/.env` | Optional app overrides (no API keys) |
| `Shipping Label Generator/Output/` | Labels and batch PDFs |
